  "params": {
   "augment_prompt": false,
   "image": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSU...(base64)",
   "n": 1,
   "prompt": "Keep only the living woman in the soot-black apron, exactly as drawn: the same warm brown skin and grey-streaked dark hair in a bun, white shirt with rolled sleeves, long soot-black apron over an ivory skirt dripping with wax at the hem, lilac ribbon, brass snuffing shears and leather pouch at her belt, the same lit white taper whose small flame is warm gold. She stands in a calm ready stance with her feet apart, holding the taper out a little in front of her in one hand, her other arm held a little away from her side. Three-quarter view from slightly above, the whole figure centred with wide empty margin on every side and clear headroom, the same painted cel style with thick clean dark outlines, flat colours with one shadow tone and one highlight, matte finish, even soft light from the front, plain flat light grey background everywhere else."
  },
  "url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/ludo-assets/api/4cb86bc5b84756c0621f28c5ffec5f93.webp",
